                                                "sense_id": "f4503462-be49-36a9-a970-460a8940b9ca",
                                                "text": "As far as I know, Atlanta doesn’t have any famous buildings. You might even say that there are no skyscrapers. Sky reachers maybe, not sky scrapers. Regardless, the city is as enchanting as my mother’s face."
                                            },
