                                                "sense_id": "f4503462-be49-36a9-a970-460a8940b9ca",
                                                "text": "In Tucker, another Atlanta suburb, an undocumented man attending church was arrested after ICE agents arrived, pastor Luis Ortiz told CNN. He said he was in the middle of his sermon when he noticed a couple of members of his church escort the man out."
